flowchart LR
    accTitle: Independent ensembles and sequential corrections
    accDescr: Bagging fits models on resampled data in parallel; boosting adds learners sequentially to improve the ensemble objective.
    Data["Training data"] --> A["Bootstrap sample A → tree A"]
    Data --> B["Bootstrap sample B → tree B"]
    A --> Average["Average or vote"]
    B --> Average
    Start["Initial prediction"] --> L1["Fit learner to improve loss"]
    L1 --> L2["Update ensemble, fit next learner"]
    L2 --> Sum["Weighted additive prediction"]
